    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add To Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1741700650\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Survive the Clutches of the Plague in the Depths of Time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Plague drags you and your friends into a terrifying time travel to the Middle Ages, where a deadly plague epidemic reigns. Face enemies using your unique abilities and find a way back to modern times by completing rituals. But be careful\u2014there might be a traitor among you trying to sabotage the group under the cursed influence of the plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Horror:</strong>\u00a0While 1-5 players work together to complete missions, try to figure out who is friend and who is foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/f00e2fe40e9a41809f476b39e00bc8b8.poster.avif?t=1741700650\" width=598 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/f00e2fe40e9a41809f476b39e00bc8b8.webm?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/f00e2fe40e9a41809f476b39e00bc8b8.mp4?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Social Dynamics:</strong>\u00a0Each player has a unique ability like invisibility, healing, premonition, role-swapping, or protection. These abilities will be very useful both against enemies and to protect yourself from the traitor among you. Votes and imprisonments will lead you to the real traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/c3288eab83b5c26c67c73235aed927a7.poster.avif?t=1741700650\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/c3288eab83b5c26c67c73235aed927a7.webm?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/c3288eab83b5c26c67c73235aed927a7.mp4?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies Beyond Time:</strong>\u00a0Struggle to survive in a dangerous environment surrounded by witches, soul burners, and swarms of rats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/20e84a130e8b5afacfc4be1aa076a049.poster.avif?t=1741700650\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/20e84a130e8b5afacfc4be1aa076a049.webm?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/20e84a130e8b5afacfc4be1aa076a049.mp4?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Different roles like seer, healer, traitor, wizard apprentice, loyal disciple, and shadow companion, along with challenging tasks, make each game a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this cursed world by completing dark rituals and uncovering secrets? In Project Plague, explore the limits of horror, psychological tension, and betrayal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Survive the Clutches of the Plague in the Depths of Time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Plague drags you and your friends into a terrifying time travel to the Middle Ages, where a deadly plague epidemic reigns. Face enemies using your unique abilities and find a way back to modern times by completing rituals. But be careful\u2014there might be a traitor among you trying to sabotage the group under the cursed influence of the plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Horror:</strong>\u00a0While 1-5 players work together to complete missions, try to figure out who is friend and who is foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/f00e2fe40e9a41809f476b39e00bc8b8.poster.avif?t=1741700650\" width=598 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/f00e2fe40e9a41809f476b39e00bc8b8.webm?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/f00e2fe40e9a41809f476b39e00bc8b8.mp4?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Social Dynamics:</strong>\u00a0Each player has a unique ability like invisibility, healing, premonition, role-swapping, or protection. These abilities will be very useful both against enemies and to protect yourself from the traitor among you. Votes and imprisonments will lead you to the real traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/c3288eab83b5c26c67c73235aed927a7.poster.avif?t=1741700650\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/c3288eab83b5c26c67c73235aed927a7.webm?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/c3288eab83b5c26c67c73235aed927a7.mp4?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies Beyond Time:</strong>\u00a0Struggle to survive in a dangerous environment surrounded by witches, soul burners, and swarms of rats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/20e84a130e8b5afacfc4be1aa076a049.poster.avif?t=1741700650\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/20e84a130e8b5afacfc4be1aa076a049.webm?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372630/extras/20e84a130e8b5afacfc4be1aa076a049.mp4?t=1741700650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Different roles like seer, healer, traitor, wizard apprentice, loyal disciple, and shadow companion, along with challenging tasks, make each game a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this cursed world by completing dark rituals and uncovering secrets? In Project Plague, explore the limits of horror, psychological tension, and betrayal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
    "short_description": "Project Plague is a multiplayer horror and survival game for 1-5 players set in a medieval world besieged by the plague. Solve mysterious rituals, use your role-specific abilities, escape deadly enemies, and protect your team in this cursed time... or betray them!",
